    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the pediatrician office is closed for the weekend and i cant get an appointment until monday. he's just kinda drowsy, not totally out of it. i'm just worried about him being thirsty. if i give him a little bit of juice or maybe some pedialyte it should help him perk up, right? i dont wanna rush to the er if it's just a little stomach bug.",
